;
; How Homestead files a home device in MYRA (homestead_rules.h HR5): its
; number, its kind (homestead_rules.h HOMESTEAD_LIGHT .. HOMESTEAD_OVEN),
; the low and high ends of its range and its setpoint, in the device's own
; unit. The rules say what the values may mean; this says whether they
; make a record.
^ZXHOME(device:i4) = kind:i1! ^ lo:i5! ^ hi:i5! ^ setpoint:i5!
